00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
Described as being a film about determination, danger and the ocean’s greatest depths, James Cameron's "Deepsea
Challenge 3D" tells the story of Cameron’s journey to fulfill his boyhood dream of becoming an explorer.

